{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10127010","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10127010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1012701001:0":{"text":"観念するんだ、イミル！","source_cn":"伊米尔，束手就擒吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B450ECFFFE85AFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012701002:0":{"text":"黙れ！私こそがユグドラシルの指導者だ！この私に命令するとは、何様のつもりだ！？","source_cn":"住口！我才是有资格号令薄暮丛林的人！而你算什么东西……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79AE45345E7730D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012701003:0":{"text":"私を出し抜けたのは、お前の運が良かったに過ぎない！ユグドラシルの力さえあれば……<style=\"highlight\">私は永遠の命</style>を手にできる！","source_cn":"我生不逢时……才让你钻了空子！然而只要拥有薄暮丛林的力...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADEAAD52F4CDBF9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1012701004:0":{"text":"森の生命力はあなたの物ではありません！木の葉はいずれ朽ち果てるもの、それが運命です！","source_cn":"丛林的生命力不属于你，所有的叶子终将枯萎，面对你的命运吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA8BFC701551352","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012701005:0":{"text":"ええい、うるさい！朽ちる定めなのはダウナエとアルドンだ！私ではない！","source_cn":"闭上你的嘴！烂在土里是达赫妮跟雅顿的命运！不是我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x028DA4F28DFA5DA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012701006:0":{"text":"頭のてっぺんから足のつま先まで腐りきっちまったようだね！イミル！","source_cn":"你简直是一颗彻头彻尾的臭豆子！伊米尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC1E17C7546DF4BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012701007:0":{"text":"ダウナエおばあさま！？","source_cn":"达赫妮婆婆？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F334BFB9DFFE3E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1012701008:0":{"text":"ほっほっほ……老いぼれ二人が来たぞい。","source_cn":"噢呵呵……看来我们这两把老骨头赶上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x435461BA36A8448F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012701009:0":{"text":"アルドン先生！","source_cn":"雅顿老师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23EDCCC26A8BDB6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012701010:0":{"text":"誰が老いぼれだい、アルドン！あんたと一緒にしないでおくれ！","source_cn":"雅顿，只有你是老骨头！我可不是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42AA45F3DBDC5787","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1012701011:0":{"text":"イミル！よくも私利私欲のために、悪党どもと手を組んで聖樹を汚したね！今